[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9127.27, "timestamp": "02:32:07", "text": "我只是把麥克風往旁邊挪了挪"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9129.349, "timestamp": "02:32:09", "text": "。你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9135.27, "timestamp": "02:32:15", "text": "知道我怎麼看出你彎腰駝背嗎"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9139.51, "timestamp": "02:32:19", "text": "？看看模特，就像看到模特的脖子。我的天哪。這就像脖子從這"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9145.03, "timestamp": "02:32:25", "text": "玩意兒裡伸出來一樣"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9147.27, "timestamp": "02:32:27", "text": "。不過我看得到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9152.95, "timestamp": "02:32:32", "text": "呃，也可能是我的手機。網路不好。不。是啊。 DL DTLS是什麼？這是新東西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9154.95, "timestamp": "02:32:34", "text": "它只是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9163.75, "timestamp": "02:32:43", "text": "它只是意味著你連接不上，夥計。你連接"}]